   "Payload": {
    "QuestionText": "<p><b>[PLACEHOLDER: IRB-APPROVED CONSENT TEXT]</b></p><p>This study takes about <b>22 minutes</b>. It requires <b>sound</b> (headphones or speakers) and a desktop or laptop computer.</p><p>You'll make a simple cartoon avatar. Some participants design it to look like someone they know, first typing that person's first name and some brief notes about them; others copy an avatar we show them. Any name and notes you type are not saved.</p><p>[Purpose, procedures, risks, benefits, compensation, confidentiality, voluntary participation, contact information.]</p>",
    "DataExportTag": "consent_text",
    "QuestionType": "DB",
